   ]
  },
  {
   "xml_index": 6,
   "xml_name": "L01_006_Square The Number",
   "display_name": "Square The Number",
   "questiontext_html": "<p>Let's try another simple arithmetic operation: squaring a number, that is, multiplying a number by itself.</p>\n<p>For example, the square of 5 is <code>5 * 5 = 25</code>.</p>\n<p><b>Your task:</b> Read a whole number and print its square.</p>\n<p><b>Example:</b></p>\n<p>Input:</p>\n<pre>5</pre>\n<p>Output:</p>\n<pre>25</pre>",
