  {
   "xml_index": 7,
   "xml_name": "L01_007_Sum Two Numbers",
   "display_name": "Sum Two Numbers",
   "questiontext_html": "<p>Let's now work with <b>two</b> numbers instead of one! You will read two whole numbers, one on each line, and print their sum.</p>\n<p>Remember: each call to <code>input()</code> reads exactly one line. So to read two numbers, call <code>int(input())</code> twice, once for each number.</p>\n<pre>a = int(input())\nb = int(input())</pre>\n<p><b>Your task:</b> Read two whole numbers (one per line) and print their sum.</p>\n<p><b>Example:</b></p>\n<p>Input:</p>\n<pre>3\n4</pre>\n<p>Output:</p>\n<pre>7</pre>",
   "answerpreload": "",
