  {
   "xml_index": 8,
   "xml_name": "L01_008_Difference Two Numbers",
   "display_name": "Difference Two Numbers",
   "questiontext_html": "<p>Just like addition, subtraction in Python uses the <code>-</code> operator.</p>\n<p><b>Your task:</b> Read two whole numbers (one per line) and print the result of subtracting the second number from the first.</p>\n<p><b>Example:</b></p>\n<p>Input:</p>\n<pre>10\n3</pre>\n<p>Output:</p>\n<pre>7</pre>\n<p>(because 10 - 3 = 7)</p>",
