   "display_name": "Product Two Numbers",
   "questiontext_html": "<p>Multiplication in Python uses the <code>*</code> operator, as you already saw in the \"Double the Number\" question.</p>\n<p><b>Your task:</b> Read two whole numbers (one per line) and print their product (the result of multiplying them).</p>\n<p><b>Example:</b></p>\n<p>Input:</p>\n<pre>3\n4</pre>\n<p>Output:</p>\n<pre>12</pre>",
