  {
   "xml_index": 14,
   "xml_name": "L01_014_Rectangle Area Perimeter",
   "display_name": "Rectangle Area Perimeter",
   "questiontext_html": "<p>Let's calculate two things about a rectangle: its <b>area</b> and its <b>perimeter</b>.</p>\n<p>Given the length <code>l</code> and breadth <code>b</code> of a rectangle:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Area = l * b</li>\n<li>Perimeter = 2 * (l + b)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Your task:</b> Read the length and breadth (two whole numbers, one per line). First print the area, then on the next line print the perimeter.</p>\n<p><b>Example:</b></p>\n<p>Input:</p>\n<pre>5\n3</pre>\n<p>Output:</p>\n<pre>15\n16</pre>\n<p>(Area = 5*3 = 15, and Perimeter = 2*(5+3) = 16)</p>",
   "answerpreload": "",
