   "display_name": "Average Three Numbers",
   "questiontext_html": "<p>Now let's find the average of three numbers instead of two. Just add them all up and divide by 3.</p>\n<p><b>Your task:</b> Read three whole numbers (one per line) and print their average.</p>\n<p><b>Example:</b></p>\n<p>Input:</p>\n<pre>3\n6\n9</pre>\n<p>Output:</p>\n<pre>6.0</pre>\n<p>(To keep things simple, all our test inputs divide evenly!)</p>",
