   "questiontext_html": "<p>Imagine you are building a simple billing program for a shop!</p>\n<p>If you buy a certain <b>quantity</b> of an item, and each item costs a certain <b>price</b>, then:</p>\n<pre>total cost = quantity * price</pre>\n<p><b>Your task:</b> Read the quantity and the price per item (two whole numbers, one per line, in that order) and print the total cost.</p>\n<p><b>Example:</b></p>\n<p>Input:</p>\n<pre>3\n50</pre>\n<p>Output:</p>\n<pre>150</pre>\n<p>(because 3 items at 50 each cost 150 in total)</p>",
